HHIISSTTOORRYY
       ppaammffiixx was new in Netpbm 10.66 (March 2014).  But it grew out  of  ppaamm‐‐
       ffiixxttrruunncc,  which  was new in Netpbm 10.38 (March 2007) and did only the
       truncated image repair (and for invalid sample values would simply pass
       them through to its output, generating an invalid Netpbm image).

